[stderr] - Project name: football-trivia-e2e
[stderr] - Workspace: `projects/football-trivia-e2e/`
[stderr] 
[stderr] ## What are we creating?
[stderr] 
[stderr] A feature-rich football trivia game for quick mobile sessions: themed rounds, multiple question formats, answer validation, scoring streaks, accessible feedback, local progress, and a curated first-release question bank.
[stderr] 
[stderr] ## Product category
[stderr] 
[stderr] - [x] Game
[stderr] 
