[stderr] ## Shared product requirements
[stderr] 
[stderr] - Accessible controls, text, captions, and visual settings
[stderr] - Save, resume, and data-loss recovery behaviour
[stderr] - Crash reporting and player-facing error recovery
[stderr] 
[stderr] ## Who is it for, and what must it help them do?
[stderr] 
[stderr] - Intended users: - Casual players
[stderr] - Adult players
[stderr] - Their primary outcome: Progress through a story or campaign.
[stderr] - What makes the first useful session successful: Finish a first battle and understand how saving works.
[stderr] 
